---
// About Section Component
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
            <!-- Left: Image -->
            <div class="relative order-2 lg:order-1">
                <div class="relative max-w-sm mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                    <!-- Background decoration -->
                    <div
                        class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-olive/20 to-brand-gray/20 rounded-[32px] blur-2xl"
                    >
                    </div>

                    <!-- Image container -->
                    <div
                        class="relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-primary to-brand-olive p-1"
                    >
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=600&h=750&fit=crop&q=80"
                            alt="團隊協作"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[20px]"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Content -->
            <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
                <span class="section-label">整合者的故事</span>

                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-text-title mb-6">
                    跨領域思維模式
                </h2>

                <div class="space-y-4 text-text-body leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                        我們的旅程由「整合」定義。憑藉工程基礎與產品管理的轉型經驗，
                        我們同時理解 AI 開發的技術細節與商業策略的高層需求。
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        目前，我們專注於 AI 與新興技術如何加速永續發展。
                        透過將敏捷專案管理應用於複雜的環境挑戰，
                        我們協助組織打造不僅高效且具未來韌性的產品。
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature highlights -->
                <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                        >
                            <svg
                                class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-primary"
                                fill="none"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-title"
                            >工程背景</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                        >
                            <svg
                                class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-secondary"
                                fill="none"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-title"
                            >產品思維</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-olive/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                        >
                            <svg
                                class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-olive"
                                fill="none"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-title"
                            >永續導向</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                        >
                            <svg
                                class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-accent"
                                fill="none"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-title"
                            >AI 驅動</span
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
